{"seq":2,"slug":"pulsars-frbs","title":"脉冲星与快速射电暴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/science/pulsars-frbs","wordCount":1876,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"脉冲星与快速射电暴\">脉冲星与快速射电暴</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>射电天空里有一类源不靠&quot;亮&quot;取胜，而靠&quot;快&quot;——它们在毫秒到秒的尺度上闪烁、脉动、爆发，把时间维度变成科学的主战场。1967 年 Jocelyn Bell 发现的第一颗脉冲星，以及 2007 年才被确认的快速射电暴（FRB），是其中两类最迷人的时域天体。它们共享一套独特的观测语言：信号经过星际介质会被&quot;色散&quot;，低频比高频晚到，而这个色散量本身就成了量天尺。这一篇讲清脉冲星与 FRB 的物理、它们对探测器（尤其<a href=\"../telescopes/single-dish\">单天线</a>大集光面积）的依赖，以及它们如何把射电望远镜变成引力波探测器和宇宙的&quot;称重秤&quot;。</p>\n<p>时域射电的核心量是色散量（DM）：脉冲穿过自由电子等离子体，群速度随频率变化，到达时延与频率的关系编码了视线上的电子柱密度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[脉冲信号] --&gt; B[星际介质色散]&#10;  B --&gt; C[低频晚到&lt;br/&gt;时延∝DM/ν²]&#10;  C --&gt; D[去色散重建脉冲]&#10;  A --&gt; E[脉冲星&lt;br/&gt;自转中子星]&#10;  A --&gt; F[快速射电暴&lt;br/&gt;毫秒级爆发]&#10;  E --&gt; G[毫秒脉冲星&lt;br/&gt;极稳定时钟]&#10;  G --&gt; H[脉冲星测时阵PTA&lt;br/&gt;纳赫兹引力波]&#10;  F --&gt; I[色散超银河&lt;br/&gt;河外起源]&#10;  I --&gt; J[探测宇宙重子&lt;br/&gt;Macquart关系]\">flowchart TD\n  A[脉冲信号] --&gt; B[星际介质色散]\n  B --&gt; C[低频晚到&lt;br/&gt;时延∝DM/ν²]\n  C --&gt; D[去色散重建脉冲]\n  A --&gt; E[脉冲星&lt;br/&gt;自转中子星]\n  A --&gt; F[快速射电暴&lt;br/&gt;毫秒级爆发]\n  E --&gt; G[毫秒脉冲星&lt;br/&gt;极稳定时钟]\n  G --&gt; H[脉冲星测时阵PTA&lt;br/&gt;纳赫兹引力波]\n  F --&gt; I[色散超银河&lt;br/&gt;河外起源]\n  I --&gt; J[探测宇宙重子&lt;br/&gt;Macquart关系]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>关系</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>色散量 DM</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∝</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>ν</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t \\propto {\\rm DM}/\\nu^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">DM</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>测电子柱密度/距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自转周期 P</td>\n<td>毫秒–秒</td>\n<td>中子星自转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期导数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>自转减慢率</td>\n<td>推磁场、年龄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法拉第旋率 RM</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mo>∥</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto \\int n_e B_\\parallel</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1602em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∥</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>测视线磁场</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"脉冲星-宇宙最精准的时钟\">脉冲星：宇宙最精准的时钟</h2><p>脉冲星是高速自转的中子星：直径约 20 公里、质量约 1.4 个太阳，磁场强达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 高斯。它的磁轴与自转轴不重合，磁极发出的射电束像灯塔一样扫过地球，我们便看到周期性脉冲。普通脉冲星周期从几十毫秒到几秒不等，自转因辐射能量损失而缓慢减慢，由周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 与其导数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可推出磁场强度与特征年龄。</p>\n<p>最珍贵的是毫秒脉冲星：被伴星吸积&quot;回收&quot;加速到毫秒级周期，自转极其稳定，长期计时精度可媲美原子钟。这种稳定性把脉冲星变成检验广义相对论的实验室——双脉冲星系统 PSR B1913+16 的轨道衰减第一次间接证实了引力波，Hulse 与 Taylor 因此获诺贝尔奖。脉冲星搜寻极度吃灵敏度，正是<a href=\"../telescopes/single-dish\">单天线</a>大集光面积的用武之地：中国 FAST 凭 500 米口径，截至 2024 年底已发现超过 1000 颗新脉冲星，超过同期国外所有望远镜发现总和。</p>\n<h2 id=\"脉冲星测时阵与纳赫兹引力波\">脉冲星测时阵与纳赫兹引力波</h2><p>把全银河系最稳定的一批毫秒脉冲星组成一个网络，长期精密计时，就构成脉冲星测时阵（PTA）——一台星系尺度的引力波探测器。原理优雅：一列穿过太阳系的纳赫兹引力波会同时扰动所有脉冲信号的到达时间，且这种扰动在天球上呈一种特定的角度相关（Hellings-Downs 曲线），可与各类噪声区分。</p>\n<p>2023 年，NANOGrav、欧洲 EPTA、中国 CPTA、澳大利亚 PPTA 四个团队独立报告了纳赫兹随机引力波背景的强证据（显著性&quot;弱&quot;到&quot;令人信服&quot;不等，尚未达 5 sigma）。这一背景很可能来自全宇宙超大质量双黑洞并合的叠加。各团队联合成的国际脉冲星测时阵（IPTA）正通过数据合并推高显著性。这条科学线把射电时域观测直接接入了引力波天文学，与本 hub 之外的高能/多信使天文学遥相呼应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"快速射电暴-毫秒级的宇宙谜题\">快速射电暴：毫秒级的宇宙谜题</h2><p>快速射电暴是持续仅几毫秒、却在那一刻亮过整个银河系的射电闪光。它们的色散量远超银河系电子所能解释，证明起源在遥远河外星系。自 2007 年首次确认以来，FRB 从个位数暴增到数千例——加拿大 CHIME 望远镜凭超大视场成为发现主力。</p>\n<p>FRB 分两类：大多数是&quot;一次性&quot;暴，少数会重复爆发。2020 年银河系内磁星 SGR 1935+2154 发出一次 FRB 量级的暴，把磁星确立为至少一部分 FRB 的起源。重复源让精确定位成为可能：CHIME 的 Outrigger 阵列（分布在不列颠哥伦比亚、西弗吉尼亚、加州）现已上线，借 VLBI（见<a href=\"../interferometry/aperture-synthesis-vlbi\">综合孔径与 VLBI</a>）实现约 50–100 毫角秒定位；超活跃源 FRB 20240114A 经 MeerKAT 与 EVN 定位到一个红移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\approx 0.13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.13</span></span></span></span></span> 的矮星系，其爆发率约为普通非重复源上限中位数的 49 倍。2025 年还实现了对单次暴 FRB 20250316A 约 13 秒差距精度的定位。</p>\n<p>更深的意义在于：FRB 的色散量测的是从源到地球路径上的全部自由电子，包括星系际介质里那些&quot;看不见的重子&quot;。Macquart 关系把 DM 与红移联系起来，使 FRB 成为称量宇宙缺失重子、绘制宇宙网的全新探针——这也是 <a href=\"ska-future\">SKA 与未来</a>寄望以海量 FRB 开展宇宙学的方向。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>重复性</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>起源线索</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一次性 FRB</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>多数 CHIME 源</td>\n<td>灾变事件？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复 FRB</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>FRB 20240114A</td>\n<td>磁星等持续源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银河系内</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>SGR 1935+2154</td>\n<td>确认磁星可产 FRB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么吃灵敏度-时域射电的苛刻门槛\">为什么吃灵敏度：时域射电的苛刻门槛</h2><p>脉冲星与 FRB 都是&quot;瞬时一闪&quot;的天体，观测窗口极短，这让它们成为射电观测里对灵敏度要求最苛刻的一类。脉冲星的单个脉冲在时间上可能只持续几毫秒；FRB 更极端，整场爆发仅数毫秒。按<a href=\"../telescopes/receivers-noise\">接收机与噪声</a>的辐射计方程，积分时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 直接压在这几毫秒的尺度上，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ν</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta T_{\\rm rms}=T_{\\rm sys}/\\sqrt{\\Delta\\nu\\,\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">rms</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2128em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">sys</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>τ</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2397em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 几乎无从借力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测对象</th>\n<th>典型持续时间</th>\n<th>可用积分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>对灵敏度的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连续谱源</td>\n<td>任意长</td>\n<td>数小时</td>\n<td>可长积分，最省力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脉冲星</td>\n<td>毫秒级脉冲</td>\n<td>单脉冲极短</td>\n<td>靠大集光面积/相干叠积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FRB</td>\n<td>数毫秒</td>\n<td>一次一闪</td>\n<td>完全依赖瞬时集光面积</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>既然无法延长时间，唯一的出路就是加大集光面积：这正是 FAST 这台 500 米<a href=\"../telescopes/single-dish\">单天线</a>凭超大有效面积在脉冲星与 FRB 搜寻上独占鳌头的根本原因——时域射电比拼的不是分辨率，而是那一瞬间能接住多少能量。这也解释了为什么大视场巡天设备（如 CHIME）在 FRB 发现上如此高产：它们用大面积同时盯住大片天空，赌的是&quot;爆发恰好发生在我看的这方向上&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时域射电的通用量是色散量 DM（时延 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>ν</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto{\\rm DM}/\\nu^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">DM</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），既用于去色散重建脉冲，也是测电子柱密度与距离的量天尺。</li>\n<li>脉冲星是自转中子星灯塔，毫秒脉冲星稳定如原子钟，是检验广义相对论的实验室；搜寻吃灵敏度，FAST 这台<a href=\"../telescopes/single-dish\">单天线</a>截至 2024 年底已发现 1000+ 颗。</li>\n<li>脉冲星测时阵把毫秒脉冲星组网成星系尺度引力波探测器，四大团队 2023 年报告纳赫兹引力波背景强证据，源于超大质量双黑洞并合。</li>\n<li>FRB 是河外毫秒级强闪，CHIME+Outrigger 借 <a href=\"../interferometry/aperture-synthesis-vlbi\">VLBI</a> 精确定位，其 DM 经 Macquart 关系成为称量宇宙缺失重子的探针，是 <a href=\"ska-future\">SKA</a> 的旗舰课题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"脉冲星与快速射电暴","id":"脉冲星与快速射电暴"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"脉冲星：宇宙最精准的时钟","id":"脉冲星-宇宙最精准的时钟"},{"level":2,"text":"脉冲星测时阵与纳赫兹引力波","id":"脉冲星测时阵与纳赫兹引力波"},{"level":2,"text":"快速射电暴：毫秒级的宇宙谜题","id":"快速射电暴-毫秒级的宇宙谜题"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么吃灵敏度：时域射电的苛刻门槛","id":"为什么吃灵敏度-时域射电的苛刻门槛"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"谱线与 21 厘米","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/science/spectral-lines-21cm"},"next":{"title":"SKA 与未来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/science/ska-future"}}